WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
Slow morning. For one.

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:05.000
A red mug and a French press sit on the kitchen counter.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:08.000
A hand tips the press toward the mug.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Coffee pours into the mug, then the press is set down.
